    "name": "Flow control 1-100 uL per min",
    "description": "Duty-cycle flow control at 100, 600 and 1600 Hz. Fixed 0.1 s pulses, rest set for 33/10/3.3/1/0.33 % duty, >= 60 s of whole cycles per step, 15 s zero before each step, 20 s continuous reference at the start and end of each frequency. Two passes, the second reversed. Priming burst at start, mid and end.",
